---

<BaseLayout
  title="C-TPAT Minimum Security Criteria: Requirements Guide | Eurocert"
  description="Eurocert news and insights on certification, standards and compliance."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/post/ctpat-minimum-security-criteria/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[50vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367726/eurocert/r2.png.png" alt="C-TPAT Security Criteria" class="w-full h-full object-cover"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#030a16] via-[#030a16]/80 to-[#030a16]/60"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 mb-6 flex-wrap"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 heading-font text-[9px] font-bold text-eurogold-400 uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400/10 border border-eurogold-400/20"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400"></span>C-TPAT</span><span class="text-white/30 text-xs">Posted On July 15, 2023</span><span class="text-white/30 text-xs">By admin</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">C-TPAT — The NEW Minimum Security Criteria from <span class="text-eurogold-400">CBP</span> for Manufacturers and Exports</h1><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-white/80 text-sm heading-font mt-6"><span class="text-white/90">Posts</span><span>/</span><span class="text-white/70">C-TPAT Minimum Security Criteria</span></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-20 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Minimum Security <span class="text-euro-600">Criteria</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">These minimum security criteria are fundamentally designed to be the building blocks for foreign manufacturers to institute effective security practices designed to optimize supply chain performance to mitigate the risk of loss, theft, and contraband smuggling that could potentially introduce terrorists and implements of terrorism into the global supply chain.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The determination and scope of criminal elements targeting world commerce through internal conspiracies requires companies, and in particular, foreign manufacturers to elevate their security practices.</p></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,rgba(212,168,67,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-20"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Key Areas</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Security Procedures &amp; <span class="text-eurogold-400">Controls</span></h2></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-eurogold-400 text-base"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Security Procedures and Controls</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comprehensive security procedures governing all aspects of manufacturing and shipping operations.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-truck text-eurogold-400 text-base"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Container and Trailer Security</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Rigorous inspection and sealing protocols for all containers and trailers to prevent unauthorized access.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-door-open text-eurogold-400 text-base"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Physical Access Controls</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Controlled entry and exit points with proper identification, logging, and monitoring systems.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-user-lock text-eurogold-400 text-base"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Personnel Security</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Background checks, verification processes, and ongoing monitoring of all personnel with access to cargo.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-eurogold-400 text-base"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Procedural Security</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Documented procedures for shipping, receiving, and handling cargo with proper chain of custody controls.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-laptop-code text-eurogold-400 text-base"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Information Technology Security</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Protection of IT systems, data integrity, and cybersecurity measures to safeguard supply chain information.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-5 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2 hover:border-eurogold-400/20 transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition-all"><i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher text-eurogold-400 text-base"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-1.5">Security Training and Threat Awareness</h4><p class="text-white/45 text-sm leading-relaxed">Regular training programs to educate employees on security threats, awareness, and response protocols.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-20 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-slate-100"><span class="text-slate-400 text-xs heading-font font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Category:</span><span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-euro-50 text-euro-600 text-xs heading-font font-medium">C-TPAT</span></div><h3 class="heading-font text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Related Posts</h3><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-10"><a class="rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group block overflow-hidden" href="/post/ctpat-compliance-vs-validation"><div class="h-32 overflow-hidden"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367735/eurocert/r3.png.png" alt="C-TPAT Compliance vs C-TPAT Validation" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"/></div><div class="p-4"><p class="text-slate-400 text-[10px] mb-1.5">December 4, 2019</p><p class="text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed group-hover:text-euro-600 transition-colors">C-TPAT Compliance vs C-TPAT Validation</p></div></a><a class="rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group block overflow-hidden" href="/post/slcp-certification"><div class="h-32 overflow-hidden"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367718/eurocert/r1.png.png" alt="SLCP Certification | SLCP | Eurocert Asia" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"/></div><div class="p-4"><p class="text-slate-400 text-[10px] mb-1.5">August 2, 2023</p><p class="text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed group-hover:text-euro-600 transition-colors">SLCP Certification | SLCP | Eurocert Asia</p></div></a><a class="rounded-xl border border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/50 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group block overflow-hidden" href="/post/sa-8000-certification"><div class="h-32 overflow-hidden"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1783576359/740846584_1759795811682176_4180866889850030433_n.webp_i3rvbl.webp" alt="SA 8000 Certification" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"/></div><div class="p-4"><p class="text-slate-400 text-[10px] mb-1.5">February 8, 2017</p><p class="text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed group-hover:text-euro-600 transition-colors">SA 8000 Certification</p></div></a></div><div class="pt-8 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between"><a class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-euro-600 transition-colors group" href="/post/ctpat-compliance-vs-validation"><i class="fas fa-arrow-left text-xs group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform"></i><div><span class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block">Previous Post</span><span class="text-xs text-slate-500">C-TPAT Compliance vs C-TPAT Validation</span></div></a><a class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-euro-600 transition-colors group text-right" href="/post/slcp-certification"><div><span class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block">Next Post</span><span class="text-xs text-slate-500">SLCP Certification | SLCP | Eurocert Asia</span></div><i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-xs group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"></i></a></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
